{"displayStem":"그림은 고전적 간소엽 일부에서 분리된 두 통로를 단순화한 독립 모식도이다. 가·나의 화살표는 각 통로의 흐름 방향을 나타낸다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 가상 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"독립 제작 구조 모식도\"><rect width=\"620\" height=\"360\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR, sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><ellipse cx=\"90\" cy=\"180\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"100\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"525\" cy=\"180\" rx=\"48\" ry=\"70\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><text x=\"22\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"22\">문맥역</text><text x=\"465\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"20\">중심정맥</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"18\">문맥·동맥</text><text x=\"45\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"18\">분지</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"18\">담관</text><path d=\"M150 140L475 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M150 165L475 165\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M175 152L445 152\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M445 152L435.9955289764732 156.3496553411123\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M445 152L435.9955289764732 147.6503446588877\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"275\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"22\">가</text><rect x=\"175\" y=\"205\" width=\"42\" height=\"50\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"222\" y=\"205\" width=\"42\" height=\"50\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"269\" y=\"205\" width=\"42\" height=\"50\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"316\" y=\"205\" width=\"42\" height=\"50\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"363\" y=\"205\" width=\"42\" he